OL,3,GNEWSAMan who fled police investigation
OL,4,Aguilty of rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who fled the UK while being
OL,7,Finvestigated for sexually assaulting a
OL,8,Fteenage girl more than 20 years ago has
OL,9,Fbeen found guilty of rape.
OL,11,FMuhammed Khalid, 55, was convicted
OL,12,Fafter a trial of five counts of rape,
OL,13,Ftwo counts of supplying Class A drugs
OL,14,Fand one count of sexual assault.
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire Police said the offences
OL,17,Fwere carried out in the Kirklees area
OL,18,Fin the late 1990s and early 2000s.
