OL,3,GNEWSAMan who fled police investigation
OL,4,Aguilty of rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FKhalid, from Huddersfield, fled the
OL,7,Fcountry in 2020 but was arrested
OL,8,Fearlier this year at Manchester Airport
OL,9,Fshortly after he arrived back. He is
OL,10,Fdue to be sentenced at Leeds Crown
OL,11,FCourt on 24 November.
